        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heating-cooling ceiling, plasterboard
Production of a heating-cooling ceiling, with plasterboard ceiling panels;
UUID: ce309c81-0ce7-3e02-9947-bcbee1d40f4a
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps. Transport of raw materials to the plant.
Location: Data sources mainly from Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for heating-cooling ceilings in commercial buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ce309c81-0ce7-3e02-9947-bcbee1d40f4a.xml</text>
